WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.300
Safex

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:09.669
After leaving London,
Candy went into a journey back home.

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:14.105
The moment when she got back,

00:00:14.255 --> 00:00:18.276
she missed a carriage on the way
to Pony's Home.

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:23.215
The carriage is now leaving.

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:29.020
It is Terry who is on that carriage.

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:52.517
Silvery homeland.

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:20.677
Kurin, do your best! Come!

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:27.813
Kurin,
we can't keep moving forward.

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:31.257
Where can we stay?

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.855
There's nothing I can see.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:41.296
Who is there?

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:44.931
It's...

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:47.235
Mr. Matthew?

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:52.540
Candy, it's really you!

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:58.079
It is real. Kurin is here too.

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:04.148
I thought it was a snowman.

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:17.062
That's great!

00:02:17.212 --> 00:02:21.836
If it hadn’t been for Mr. Matthew,
I might have been in trouble by now.

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:26.971
I thought you were ghosts,
at the moment I found you.

00:02:27.121 --> 00:02:29.446
Do you want to eat something?

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.744
That's all right.

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:37.354
Kurin, don't be naughty.

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:43.021
The snow has stopped.

00:02:43.171 --> 00:02:45.394
Mr. Matthew, I should leave now.

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:50.195
Say hello to Sister Pony
and Sister Lane for me.

00:02:50.345 --> 00:02:51.464
Yes!

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:55.239
Excuse me.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.475
Candy!

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:02.538
Your luggage.

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:05.012
My goodness!

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:08.916
Good-bye.

00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:15.284
Even after coming back from England,
she hasn't changed a bit.

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:18.823
What do you say?

00:03:18.973 --> 00:03:21.662
Nothing! The weather is fine!

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:32.804
Kurin, wait!

00:03:32.954 --> 00:03:36.337
Pony's home
is right at the end of the road.

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:42.487
Sister Pony, Sister Lane, I'm home!

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:45.116
Candy!

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:50.191
Candy!

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.895
Boss Candy!

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:57.433
Stop!

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:00.600
Jimmy

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.074
It is really you!

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:05.170
Jimmy!

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.678
Boss!

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:09.537
Boss, it's not a dream, is it?

00:04:09.687 --> 00:04:12.879
Yes, Jimmy. I'm home.

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:15.513
I...

00:04:15.663 --> 00:04:20.150
I saw someone there,
I wasn't sure it's you.

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:24.692
It is you for sure!

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:30.200
Jimmy, you've grown tall already,
still like a child.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.495
Let me have a look.

00:04:35.074 --> 00:04:37.669
I am working for Mr. Cartwright now.

00:04:37.819 --> 00:04:39.735
The cowboy?

00:04:41.247 --> 00:04:43.408
Something like that!

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:47.119
Boss, Sister Pony and others
will be happy to see you.

00:04:47.553 --> 00:04:49.981
They were worried about you yesterday.

00:04:50.131 --> 00:04:52.547
How are Sister Pony and others?

00:04:53.159 --> 00:04:55.855
Of course, everybody is fine.

00:04:56.696 --> 00:04:58.323
Let's hurry!

00:04:59.265 --> 00:05:00.892
Give everybody a big surprise.

00:05:01.534 --> 00:05:04.162
They'll talk about this endlessly.

00:05:04.312 --> 00:05:06.899
Just like before.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:11.072
Just like before?

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:15.340
Yes, there was a man here.

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:19.111
A man was here? What kind of man?

00:05:20.119 --> 00:05:22.480
Handsome and disagreeable.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:25.149
Disagreeable? Handsome?

00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:31.222
What is his name, Jimmy?

00:05:31.898 --> 00:05:34.458
Something like Terrius, I remember.

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:38.328
Terrius?

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:40.461
It's Terry.

00:05:48.981 --> 00:05:53.042
Terry, I've never expected
you would come to the Pony's Home.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:01.153
Could it be a dream
that you come to the Pony's Home?

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:05.591
Terry!

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:09.224
Boss!

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:18.038
I want to see you, Terry!

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.515
Pony's Home... Terry is there.

00:06:28.254 --> 00:06:30.722
Terry.

00:06:46.172 --> 00:06:47.799
Pony's Home.

00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:52.067
Terry!

00:06:55.114 --> 00:06:57.674
Terry!

00:07:00.253 --> 00:07:02.221
Candy!

00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:05.617
Sister Lane.

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:09.187
Where is Terry?

00:07:09.337 --> 00:07:12.629
Why are you here, Candy?

00:07:12.832 --> 00:07:13.891
Terry!

00:07:14.041 --> 00:07:16.194
Candy, wait!

00:07:16.344 --> 00:07:19.261
Sister Pony!

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:22.074
What's the matter?

00:07:23.843 --> 00:07:25.902
- Terry!
- Candy!

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.907
Terry.

00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:41.491
Sister Pony, where is Terry?

00:07:43.863 --> 00:07:46.661
Terrius G. Grandchester.

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:52.797
He had already left thirty minutes ago.

00:07:58.845 --> 00:08:03.111
After visiting the Pony's hill
he just left.

00:08:05.651 --> 00:08:07.118
Candy!

00:08:09.188 --> 00:08:11.213
Candy, wait!

00:08:12.959 --> 00:08:15.018
He took the carriage already.

00:08:16.128 --> 00:08:17.220
Candy!

00:08:20.333 --> 00:08:22.426
Maybe I can still catch up with him.

00:08:23.736 --> 00:08:24.930
Terry!

00:08:29.275 --> 00:08:30.674
Terry!

00:08:32.078 --> 00:08:33.306
Terry!

00:08:33.946 --> 00:08:35.470
Terry!

00:08:36.082 --> 00:08:38.414
Terry!

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:44.118
Terry!

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:49.818
Terry!

00:08:58.337 --> 00:09:00.828
Terry...

00:09:04.043 --> 00:09:10.676
Terry, I can find you nowhere.

00:09:13.152 --> 00:09:18.283
The moment I got home,
Terry was here by himself.

00:09:20.259 --> 00:09:23.695
Wearing the overcoats and stand here.

00:09:25.298 --> 00:09:28.096
The coffee cup is still warm.

00:09:28.968 --> 00:09:33.234
The footprints in the snow
are still there.

00:09:35.141 --> 00:09:40.807
Terry, I'm coming home now.

00:09:42.181 --> 00:09:45.878
I miss you so much...

00:09:47.119 --> 00:09:49.110
I miss you.

00:10:08.975 --> 00:10:12.837
It was about noon...

00:10:12.987 --> 00:10:19.078
He stood in front of Pony's Home,
looking sad.

00:10:37.069 --> 00:10:41.438
You are Candy's friend from London?

00:10:42.174 --> 00:10:45.169
Is something wrong with Candy?

00:10:45.319 --> 00:10:47.940
No, she is fine.

00:10:51.384 --> 00:10:57.289
I wanted to visit the place
where Candy grew up.

00:10:58.257 --> 00:11:02.186
Excuse me, you and Candy...

00:11:02.336 --> 00:11:04.092
We are good friend.

00:11:05.631 --> 00:11:08.862
Sorry to bother you.

00:11:10.469 --> 00:11:12.403
You're leaving?

00:11:13.673 --> 00:11:19.703
I am in a hurry.
Where is Pony's hill?

00:11:20.312 --> 00:11:23.074
That father tree over there.

00:11:23.224 --> 00:11:29.019
There's a road on its left side.
Follow it and cross the river.

00:11:30.956 --> 00:11:34.118
He asked the carriage to wait.

00:11:34.268 --> 00:11:39.893
Then he walked to the hill step by step.

00:11:42.935 --> 00:11:44.129
Terry...

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:51.435
You visited Pony's Home.
What do you wanted to know?

00:12:03.355 --> 00:12:06.722
This is my second Pony's hill.

00:12:07.159 --> 00:12:10.185
You can't smoke here.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.193
Give me the cigarette!

00:12:20.106 --> 00:12:22.404
Not just one, I want them all.

00:12:22.842 --> 00:12:24.742
Here! In exchange for that.

00:12:48.901 --> 00:12:53.099
Don't be sad, Candy!

00:12:56.108 --> 00:12:58.201
You warmed up?
I made you some cocoa.

00:13:03.282 --> 00:13:05.409
It smells so good! I'll take it!

00:13:05.785 --> 00:13:10.119
Candy, how could you leave
St. Paul academy?

00:13:12.358 --> 00:13:14.852
Why are you so panicked?

00:13:15.002 --> 00:13:19.056
Sister Lane,
let's talk about it tomorrow.

00:13:19.206 --> 00:13:21.531
It would be better to make it clear now.

00:13:22.034 --> 00:13:26.266
Candy, has it got to do with Terry?

00:13:26.639 --> 00:13:33.238
No, it's only because
I don't want to rely on anyone.

00:13:33.512 --> 00:13:37.074
It is not shameful
to accept others' help.

00:13:37.224 --> 00:13:39.014
Sister Lane.

00:13:41.287 --> 00:13:46.418
Candy, you must be tired,
why don't you take some sleep?

00:13:47.259 --> 00:13:50.788
Sister Pony always dotes on Candy.

00:13:50.938 --> 00:13:54.230
Never mind!
Let's talk about it tomorrow.

00:13:54.466 --> 00:13:58.903
Sister Pony, Sister Lane,
you didn't change a bit.

00:14:00.139 --> 00:14:03.868
Okay! Let's talk about it tomorrow.

00:14:04.018 --> 00:14:06.844
- Okay, Candy?
- Yes.

00:14:11.584 --> 00:14:13.211
Candy!

00:14:13.385 --> 00:14:16.843
I will get up early tomorrow.

00:14:22.828 --> 00:14:25.189
Good night, Sister Pony.

00:14:25.339 --> 00:14:27.664
Good night!

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:31.126
Sister Pony, what happened to Candy?

00:14:32.137 --> 00:14:36.567
She was away for a long time.

00:14:36.717 --> 00:14:38.200
Is that so?

00:14:39.645 --> 00:14:44.947
The day Candy and Annie were abandoned
it was snowing too.

00:14:53.959 --> 00:14:59.397
What can I say?
We brought her up since she was a baby.

00:15:24.523 --> 00:15:29.392
Returning from London,
she has become a lady now.

00:15:30.496 --> 00:15:33.897
No, Candy is changed.

00:15:34.166 --> 00:15:38.462
She is not a child anymore.

00:15:38.612 --> 00:15:40.437
Sister Pony.

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:46.840
Have you noticed?
The expression when she got home.

00:15:47.379 --> 00:15:51.338
We haven't seen her for one year
Whose name did she call?

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:57.118
Terry!

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.084
Really.

00:16:00.234 --> 00:16:04.027
She no longer shouts for us,
sister Pony.

00:16:04.663 --> 00:16:08.064
Candy has grown up already.

00:16:09.101 --> 00:16:12.195
From now on, we may not...

00:16:12.671 --> 00:16:17.131
treat her as a child anymore.

00:16:41.734 --> 00:16:47.070
Terry visits my homeland alone.

00:16:47.773 --> 00:16:51.106
I should treasure his compliment.

00:16:52.244 --> 00:16:55.639
Terry, at this moment
the most important thing for us...

00:16:55.789 --> 00:16:57.641
it's not to meet again.

00:16:57.791 --> 00:17:02.119
We must look for our goal and go for it.

00:17:03.055 --> 00:17:07.492
We will meet again someday.

00:17:14.066 --> 00:17:15.893
They're all asleep.

00:17:16.043 --> 00:17:19.697
Candy's bed is small for her.

00:17:19.847 --> 00:17:23.799
Really, she has grown up indeed.

00:17:29.715 --> 00:17:32.076
Sister Pony, Sister Lane.

00:17:32.226 --> 00:17:36.144
They take care of me all the time.

00:17:37.389 --> 00:17:41.951
It's so good at home. Really good.

00:17:48.867 --> 00:17:50.664
Boss!

00:17:51.103 --> 00:17:56.871
Boss, get up quickly!

00:17:59.678 --> 00:18:02.806
Who's shouting there? I'm not...

00:18:02.981 --> 00:18:04.744
It's cold!

00:18:05.084 --> 00:18:09.246
You're getting weak,
the boss was not like that before.

00:18:09.396 --> 00:18:12.848
What do you say?
I am just careless.

00:18:13.158 --> 00:18:15.092
Wait there, I'll change my clothes.

00:18:17.262 --> 00:18:18.889
Jimmy, turn around.

00:18:21.834 --> 00:18:26.271
Thanks, Jimmy.
I'll catch you out there.

00:18:27.973 --> 00:18:30.300
Candy, where are you going?

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:34.277
Sister Lane,
I need some exercise before breakfast.

00:18:35.647 --> 00:18:36.909
Jimmy!

00:18:37.349 --> 00:18:42.218
Boss, you're doing well, over here!

00:18:47.159 --> 00:18:49.186
You are too cunning.

00:18:49.336 --> 00:18:52.059
You're just standing there.

00:18:53.132 --> 00:18:55.592
Candy's still naughty.

00:18:55.742 --> 00:18:59.694
Like the old time, I guess.

00:19:02.274 --> 00:19:04.101
Boss!

00:19:04.251 --> 00:19:07.839
Jimmy, what are you doing?
Over here, quick!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:11.809
I almost forgot.
We have something to show you.

00:19:11.959 --> 00:19:13.442
Something?

00:19:13.785 --> 00:19:17.084
Right! For your coming home.

00:19:17.589 --> 00:19:19.850
Hurry up!

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:22.223
All finished by everybody.

00:19:22.694 --> 00:19:27.222
Please unveil.
Claps hands, everybody.

00:19:33.639 --> 00:19:36.301
We got up very early for this.

00:19:36.475 --> 00:19:39.239
Boss, welcome back!

00:19:41.346 --> 00:19:43.075
Thank you!

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:47.044
This present is excellent.

00:19:47.194 --> 00:19:51.115
-It's you, right?
-Which one is really?

00:19:51.265 --> 00:19:55.092
Yes, It's really look like me.

00:19:55.494 --> 00:19:58.793
Only those two pigtails...

00:20:07.439 --> 00:20:11.466
Everybody,
let's dance to welcome the boss.

00:20:56.955 --> 00:21:01.551
Standing in the snowfield,
Candy feels no cold at all.

00:21:02.494 --> 00:21:06.055
Everything makes her feel so warm.

00:21:07.165 --> 00:21:09.429
Terry called on the Pony's Home.

00:21:09.635 --> 00:21:13.196
Sister Pony, Sister Lane,
and the children.

00:21:14.039 --> 00:21:17.702
Candy feels so warm about everything.
